% expect-output: 60.0
% expect-output: 0.0
% expect-output: 3.0
% expect-output: 5.0
% Scenario: xshow positions each glyph by its own number, replacing the
% width; yshow and xyshow likewise for the other axis and both.
% Expect: 60.0 0.0 after xshow, then 3.0 5.0 after xyshow.
/r { 1000 mul round 1000 div } def
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 moveto (abc) [10 20 30] xshow currentpoint r exch r = =
0 0 moveto (ab) [1 2 2 3] xyshow currentpoint r exch r = =
showpage
